{"id":"d96a123476b0bcd3","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-canonical-decision-tree.md","title":"DNF 的典范决策树","display":"df-canonical-decision-tree — DNF 的典范决策树","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-canonical-decision-tree","aliases":["29-df-canonical-decision-tree"],"display":"df-canonical-decision-tree — DNF 的典范决策树","depends_on":["[[29-df-ordered-dnf]]","[[29-df-boolean-restriction]]"],"source_locator":"Section13.1, p.204, DjVu scan219, definition of T(F)","source_basis":"扫描219原图核对完整块查询与递归接树；有限带标签元组、增序变量表及空公式边界为本地编码。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-canonical-decision-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-canonical-decision-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-canonical-decision-tree — DNF 的典范决策树"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e376b5c876ef4c86\" href=\"?note=e376b5c876ef4c86\" title=\"29-df-ordered-dnf\">29-df-ordered-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e25523dc1eeba65a\" href=\"?note=e25523dc1eeba65a\" title=\"29-df-boolean-restriction\">29-df-boolean-restriction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section13.1, p.204, DjVu scan219, definition of T(F)"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"扫描219原图核对完整块查询与递归接树；有限带标签元组、增序变量表及空公式边界为本地编码。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DNF}_n,\\mathsf{Term}_n,R_n,b_n\">\\(\\mathsf{DNF}_n,\\mathsf{Term}_n,R_n,b_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e376b5c876ef4c86\" href=\"?note=e376b5c876ef4c86\" title=\"29-df-ordered-dnf\">29-df-ordered-dnf</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_n,\\mathbb B,\\widehat a_n\">\\(V_n,\\mathbb B,\\widehat a_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e25523dc1eeba65a\" href=\"?note=e25523dc1eeba65a\" title=\"29-df-boolean-restriction\">29-df-boolean-restriction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n\">\\(F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下式用带不同首标签的有限元组编码叶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L(b)\">\\(\\mathsf L(b)\\)</span> 和二叉节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1)\">\\(\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1)\\)</span>，并定义全部有限树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf D_n\">\\(\\mathsf D_n\\)</span>、高度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_n:\\mathsf D_n\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h_n:\\mathsf D_n\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 和求值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_n:\\mathsf D_n\\times\\mathbb B^{V_n}\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(e_n:\\mathsf D_n\\times\\mathbb B^{V_n}\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V_n\">\\(S\\subseteq V_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inc}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{inc}(S)\\)</span> 在下式定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的唯一严格递增枚举。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_n\">\\(V_n\\)</span> 中无重复元素的有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[J]=\\{J_j:1\\leq j\\leq|J|\\}\">\\([J]=\\{J_j:1\\leq j\\leq|J|\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb B^{[J]}\\to\\mathsf D_n\">\\(g:\\mathbb B^{[J]}\\to\\mathsf D_n\\)</span>。递归式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\notin[J]\">\\(i\\notin[J]\\)</span>；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,b}\">\\(\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,b}\\)</span> 的输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb B^{[J]\\cup\\{i\\}}\\to\\mathsf D_n\">\\(g:\\mathbb B^{[J]\\cup\\{i\\}}\\to\\mathsf D_n\\)</span>，输出的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^{[J]}\">\\(\\mathbb B^{[J]}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Build}_n(J,g)\">\\(\\operatorname{Build}_n(J,g)\\)</span> 把每个完整赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb B^{[J]}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb B^{[J]}\\)</span> 对应的树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(a)\">\\(g(a)\\)</span> 接到查询完 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 的对应叶上。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n:\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\to\\mathsf D_n\">\\(T_n:\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\to\\mathsf D_n\\)</span> 与辅助族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{n,C,F}:\\mathbb B^{\\operatorname{dom}(C)}\\to\\mathsf D_n\">\\(\\Gamma_{n,C,F}:\\mathbb B^{\\operatorname{dom}(C)}\\to\\mathsf D_n\\)</span> 由下式同时递归定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 仅调用较短项序列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L(b)\\coloneqq\\langle0,b\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1)\\coloneqq\\langle1,i,T_0,T_1\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf L(b)\\coloneqq\\langle0,b\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1)\\coloneqq\\langle1,i,T_0,T_1\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf D_n^{(0)}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf L(b)\\mid b\\in\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad\\mathsf D_n^{(q+1)}\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_n^{(q)}\\cup\\{\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1)\\mid i\\in V_n\\land T_0,T_1\\in\\mathsf D_n^{(q)}\\},\\qquad\\mathsf D_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf D_n^{(q)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf D_n^{(0)}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf L(b)\\mid b\\in\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad\\mathsf D_n^{(q+1)}\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_n^{(q)}\\cup\\{\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1)\\mid i\\in V_n\\land T_0,T_1\\in\\mathsf D_n^{(q)}\\},\\qquad\\mathsf D_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf D_n^{(q)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_n(\\mathsf L(b))\\coloneqq0,\\qquad h_n(\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1))\\coloneqq1+\\max\\{h_n(T_0),h_n(T_1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_n(\\mathsf L(b))\\coloneqq0,\\qquad h_n(\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1))\\coloneqq1+\\max\\{h_n(T_0),h_n(T_1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_n(\\mathsf L(b),x)\\coloneqq b,\\qquad e_n(\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1),x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}e_n(T_0,x),&amp;x(i)=0,\\\\e_n(T_1,x),&amp;x(i)=1.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_n(\\mathsf L(b),x)\\coloneqq b,\\qquad e_n(\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1),x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}e_n(T_0,x),&amp;x(i)=0,\\\\e_n(T_1,x),&amp;x(i)=1.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inc}(S)=\\langle i_1,\\ldots,i_t\\rangle\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ t=|S|\\land\\{i_1,\\ldots,i_t\\}=S\\land\\forall j\\;(1\\leq j&lt;t\\to i_j&lt;i_{j+1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{inc}(S)=\\langle i_1,\\ldots,i_t\\rangle\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ t=|S|\\land\\{i_1,\\ldots,i_t\\}=S\\land\\forall j\\;(1\\leq j&lt;t\\to i_j&lt;i_{j+1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,b}(g)(a)\\coloneqq g(a\\cup\\{\\langle i,b\\rangle\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,b}(g)(a)\\coloneqq g(a\\cup\\{\\langle i,b\\rangle\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Build}_n(\\langle\\rangle,g)\\coloneqq g(\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Build}_n(\\langle\\rangle,g)\\coloneqq g(\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Build}_n(\\langle i\\rangle\\frown J,g)\\coloneqq\\mathsf N\\!\\left(i,\\operatorname{Build}_n(J,\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,0}(g)),\\operatorname{Build}_n(J,\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,1}(g))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Build}_n(\\langle i\\rangle\\frown J,g)\\coloneqq\\mathsf N\\!\\left(i,\\operatorname{Build}_n(J,\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,0}(g)),\\operatorname{Build}_n(J,\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,1}(g))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_n(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathsf L(0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_n(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathsf L(0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{n,C,F}(a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathsf L(1),&amp;a=C,\\\\T_n(R_n(F,\\widehat a_n)),&amp;a\\ne C.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma_{n,C,F}(a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathsf L(1),&amp;a=C,\\\\T_n(R_n(F,\\widehat a_n)),&amp;a\\ne C.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_n(\\langle C\\rangle\\frown F)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Build}_n(\\operatorname{inc}(\\operatorname{dom}(C)),\\Gamma_{n,C,F}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_n(\\langle C\\rangle\\frown F)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Build}_n(\\operatorname{inc}(\\operatorname{dom}(C)),\\Gamma_{n,C,F}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这保留了原书“先完整查询首项全部变量，再在唯一满足叶停为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，在其他叶接剩余 DNF 的树”的构造。没有把它替换成发现首个不匹配文字就立刻停止的另一种短路树；二者树高可能不同。原书未限定项内查询顺序，这里固定为变量编号递增序，所有后续限制仍使用此顺序。</p>\n<p>所有有限树的结构递归唯一确定高度和求值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Build}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{Build}_n\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|J|\">\\(|J|\\)</span> 递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span> 按项序列长度递归，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_n(F,\\widehat a_n)\">\\(R_n(F,\\widehat a_n)\\)</span> 的长度至多为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|F|\">\\(|F|\\)</span>，严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\langle C\\rangle\\frown F|\">\\(|\\langle C\\rangle\\frown F|\\)</span>。每次得到的树有限。这些递归没有依赖待定义树的存在作前提。</p>\n<p>空 DNF 返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L(0)\">\\(\\mathsf L(0)\\)</span>。首项是空赋值时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(\\varnothing)=\\mathsf L(1)\">\\(\\Gamma(\\varnothing)=\\mathsf L(1)\\)</span> 且查询序列为空，所以直接返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L(1)\">\\(\\mathsf L(1)\\)</span>。由项数归纳及限制语义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_n(T_n(F),x)=b_n(F,x)\">\\(e_n(T_n(F),x)=b_n(F,x)\\)</span>。沿一条分支，已查询的变量被限制操作从以后所有项删去，因此不重复查询；特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_n(T_n(R_n(F,\\rho)))\\leq|U_n(\\rho)|\">\\(h_n(T_n(R_n(F,\\rho)))\\leq|U_n(\\rho)|\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ordered-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"e376b5c876ef4c86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordered-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-boolean-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"e25523dc1eeba65a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-boolean-restriction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordered-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"e376b5c876ef4c86","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathsf{DNF}_n,\\mathsf{Term}_n,R_n,b_n$ 见 [[29-df-ordered-dnf]]；$V_n,\\mathbb B,\\widehat a_n$ 见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]。$F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n$，$C\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n$，$x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-boolean-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"e25523dc1eeba65a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathsf{DNF}_n,\\mathsf{Term}_n,R_n,b_n$ 见 [[29-df-ordered-dnf]]；$V_n,\\mathbb B,\\widehat a_n$ 见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]。$F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n$，$C\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n$，$x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DNF}_n,\\mathsf{Term}_n,R_n,b_n","display":false},{"tex":"V_n,\\mathbb B,\\widehat a_n","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L(b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf D_n","display":false},{"tex":"h_n:\\mathsf D_n\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e_n:\\mathsf D_n\\times\\mathbb B^{V_n}\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq V_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{inc}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"V_n","display":false},{"tex":"[J]=\\{J_j:1\\leq j\\leq|J|\\}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb B^{[J]}\\to\\mathsf D_n","display":false},{"tex":"i\\notin[J]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,b}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb B^{[J]\\cup\\{i\\}}\\to\\mathsf D_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^{[J]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Build}_n(J,g)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb B^{[J]}","display":false},{"tex":"g(a)","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"T_n:\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\to\\mathsf D_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{n,C,F}:\\mathbb B^{\\operatorname{dom}(C)}\\to\\mathsf D_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"T_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L(b)\\coloneqq\\langle0,b\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1)\\coloneqq\\langle1,i,T_0,T_1\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf D_n^{(0)}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf L(b)\\mid b\\in\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad\\mathsf D_n^{(q+1)}\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_n^{(q)}\\cup\\{\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1)\\mid i\\in V_n\\land T_0,T_1\\in\\mathsf D_n^{(q)}\\},\\qquad\\mathsf D_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf D_n^{(q)}.","display":true},{"tex":"h_n(\\mathsf L(b))\\coloneqq0,\\qquad h_n(\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1))\\coloneqq1+\\max\\{h_n(T_0),h_n(T_1)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"e_n(\\mathsf L(b),x)\\coloneqq b,\\qquad e_n(\\mathsf N(i,T_0,T_1),x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}e_n(T_0,x),&x(i)=0,\\\\e_n(T_1,x),&x(i)=1.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{inc}(S)=\\langle i_1,\\ldots,i_t\\rangle\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ t=|S|\\land\\{i_1,\\ldots,i_t\\}=S\\land\\forall j\\;(1\\leq j<t\\to i_j<i_{j+1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,b}(g)(a)\\coloneqq g(a\\cup\\{\\langle i,b\\rangle\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Build}_n(\\langle\\rangle,g)\\coloneqq g(\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Build}_n(\\langle i\\rangle\\frown J,g)\\coloneqq\\mathsf N\\!\\left(i,\\operatorname{Build}_n(J,\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,0}(g)),\\operatorname{Build}_n(J,\\operatorname{Slice}_{i,1}(g))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"T_n(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathsf L(0).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{n,C,F}(a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathsf L(1),&a=C,\\\\T_n(R_n(F,\\widehat a_n)),&a\\ne C.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"T_n(\\langle C\\rangle\\frown F)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Build}_n(\\operatorname{inc}(\\operatorname{dom}(C)),\\Gamma_{n,C,F}).","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Build}_n","display":false},{"tex":"|J|","display":false},{"tex":"T_n","display":false},{"tex":"R_n(F,\\widehat a_n)","display":false},{"tex":"|F|","display":false},{"tex":"|\\langle C\\rangle\\frown F|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L(0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(\\varnothing)=\\mathsf L(1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L(1)","display":false},{"tex":"e_n(T_n(F),x)=b_n(F,x)","display":false},{"tex":"h_n(T_n(R_n(F,\\rho)))\\leq|U_n(\\rho)|","display":false}],"bytes":4272,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-boolean-restriction]]、[[29-df-canonical-decision-tree]]、[[29-df-ordered-dnf]]、[[29-lem-hastad-switching]]、[[29-thm-parity-ac0]] — 随机限制、DNF 规范树、切换引理及非一致 AC⁰ 奇偶性下界"},{"id":"d7ed38c661c35e87","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal R_n^r$ 是恰有 $r$ 个自由变量的全部限制，见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]；$T_n$ 和 $h_n$ 是 [[29-df-canonical-decision-tree]] 的完整块查询树与边数高度。概率取有限集合 $\\mathcal R_n^r$ 上的均匀分布，不采用各坐标独立留空的另一分布。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-canonical-decision-tree]]"}],"outgoing":["e376b5c876ef4c86","e25523dc1eeba65a"]}